{"id":146,"gn":"Pokémon Flamme","ft":["L’un des Pokémon Oiseaux légendaires. On dit que sa venue annonce l’arrivée du printemps.","Le légendaire oiseau du feu. Une pluie de flammes surgit à chaque battement de ses ailes.","Sulfura est un Pokémon Oiseau légendaire capable de contrôler le feu. On raconte que lorsque ce Pokémon est blessé, il se baigne dans le magma en ébullition d’un volcan pour se soigner.","Quand ce Pokémon oiseau légendaire agite ses ailes de feu, même la nuit noire s’embrase et rougeoie.","Il s’agit d’un des Pokémon oiseaux légendaires. Des flammes rouges d’une grande beauté étincellent lorsqu’il bat des ailes.","On raconte qu’il a sauvé des personnes perdues en montagne en illuminant les sentiers à l’aide de ses splendides ailes flamboyantes."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":0,"25":2,"26":2,"31":3,"32":3,"33":4,"34":5},"gr":-1,"cr":3,"hc":80,"bh":35,"eg":["Inconnu"],"gw":"slow","gm":{"swcrown":[0,204],"sw":[2,204],"lgpe":[0,146],"xy":[1,153],"hgss":[0,242],"frlg":[0,146],"c":[0,237],"gs":[0,237],"y":[0,146],"rb":[0,146]},"f":{"146":{"n":"Sulfura","t":["fire","flying"],"s":[90,100,90,125,85,90],"h":2,"w":60,"a":[[46,0],[49,1]],"ps":[[1,[90,100,90,125,125,90]]],"av":["swcrown","sw","lgpe","xy","hgss","frlg","c","gs","y","rb"],"ls":[{"l":[[16,1],[43,1],[52,5],[219,10],[17,15],[97,20],[246,25],[510,30],[403,35],[355,40],[257,45],[241,50],[542,55],[203,60],[682,65],[143,70]],"m":[19,53,63,76,83,97,126,129,156,164,173,182,201,203,211,214,219,240,241,257,261,263,311,315,369,394,403,413,416,496,542,595],"t":[807,814,815]},{"l":[[17,1],[52,1],[83,8],[43,16],[403,24],[53,32],[97,40],[257,48],[355,56],[76,64],[143,72]],"m":[19,29,53,63,76,92,115,126,156,164,182,261,263,355,369]},{"l":[[355,1],[542,1],[143,1],[257,1],[17,1],[52,1],[83,8],[97,15],[203,22],[246,29],[53,36],[219,43],[403,50],[241,57],[257,64],[76,71],[143,78],[355,85],[542,92]],"m":[19,46,53,63,76,92,104,126,156,164,182,201,207,211,214,216,218,219,237,240,241,249,261,263,315,332,355,369,416,48